WEBVTT

00:05:28.758 --> 00:05:31.123
When I finished my sentence,

00:05:31.147 --> 00:05:35.473
this big, burly father-to-be stands up,

00:05:35.497 --> 00:05:38.227
and I thought for sure he was leaving.

00:05:38.251 --> 00:05:41.948
But instead, in a really gruff,
commanding way, he says,

00:05:41.972 --> 00:05:43.139
"Alright, you guys,

00:05:43.163 --> 00:05:46.409
how many of you have cried
during this thing,

00:05:46.433 --> 00:05:48.200
you know, her pregnancy?"

00:05:49.353 --> 00:05:52.204
I scan the class
to make sure everybody was OK.

00:05:52.228 --> 00:05:53.403
They were fine,

00:05:53.427 --> 00:05:56.276
they were just very intent
on what was going to happen next.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:06:00.402
And then, one gentleman
raises his hand and says, "I have."